      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I remember there was some information about introducing an option to change contrast and sharpness on the VRC side to the HMD side, but I would like to see the same functionality in the camera.\nThe best thing would be to take advantage of the Unity post-process being an asset and be able to insert adjustable camera effects like avatar uploads.... (This is an element that would be very exciting to sell on assets and on the VRC)\nIt would be nice to be able to use effects commonly used in Reshade, such as LUTs and depth buffer-based effects, to take interesting pictures.\nAlmost forgot, I would like to see effects layering.",
